  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.12 Jurisprudence Examination Fee for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Mental Health Practice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.12 Jurisprudence Examination Fee for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Mental Health Practice. The fee for the jurisprudence examination for the professions regulated by the board of mental health practice under RSA 330-A shall be $60.\n\nSource. #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
